Label only our persistent boot-log directory, not Android's other metadata.
This unencrypted partition lets the owner recover logs from Linux after a hang.
Drop this entry with the dedicated boot logger.

--- a/system/etc/selinux/plat_file_contexts
+++ b/system/etc/selinux/plat_file_contexts
@@ -769,3 +769,4 @@
 /mnt/vm u:object_r:vm_data_file:s0
 /second_stage_resources/overlay_remounter u:object_r:overlay_remounter_exec:s0
 /system/bin/casefolding_remover u:object_r:casefolding_remover_exec:s0
+/metadata/gbos-builder-bootlog(/.*)? u:object_r:gbos_builder_bootlog_file:s0
